"font-size:12px;\"><br>&nbsp 계급</font><a class=\"tooltip-right\" tooltip-data=\"조합 계급 F\" href=\"EXEC: msg $guild_brand_chart & $info_text = $guild_brand_help & gt $curloc\">    <font color=\"#cd0000\">조합 신입</font></a>\r\n<font style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>&nbsp 생활</font><a class=\"tooltip-right\" tooltip-data=\"생활수준 S\" href=\"EXEC: msg $wealth_chart & $info_text = $wealth_help & gt $curloc\">    <font color=\"#009900\">호화로운 삶</font></a>\r\n<font style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>&nbsp 청결</font><a class=\"tooltip-right\" tooltip-data=\"청결도 S\" href=\"EXEC: msg $hygiene_chart & $info_text = $hygiene_help & gt $curloc\">    <font color=\"#009900\">상쾌함</font></a>\r\n<font style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>&nbsp 기분</font><a class=\"tooltip-right\" tooltip-data=\"기분 B\" href=\"EXEC: msg $mood_chart & $info_text = $mood_help & gt $curloc\">    <font color=\"#0D0D0D\">차분함</font></a>\r\n<font style=\"font-size:12px;\"><br>&nbsp 건강</font><a class=\"tooltip-right\" tooltip-data=\"건강 상태 S\" href=\"EXEC: msg $wounds_chart & $info_text = $wounds_help & gt $curloc\">    <font color=\"#009900\">무사</font></a></div><div id=\"left_column_master_rules\">\r\n <font style=\"font-size:23px;\"> 자동 마법사용</font><br>\r\n     아우스펙스\r\n     마그나 마그니피카\r\n     센텐티아 베리타스\r\n\r\n     시전장면 스킵<br><br><font style=\"font-size:15px;\">  매일 스파크가 소모됩니다</font></div></div><div id=\"chekbox_200\"><a href = \"EXEC: auspex_auto_cast = 0 & $info_text = $auspex_help[1] & gt $curloc\"><img src=\"content/pic/ui/buttons/legacy/sel_button.png\"></a></div><div id=\"chekbox_201\"><a href = \"EXEC: magna_magnifika_auto_cast = 0 & $info_text = $magna_help[1] & gt $curloc\"><img src=\"content/pic/ui/buttons/legacy/sel_button.png\"></a></div><div id=\"chekbox_202\"><a href = \"EXEC: sententia_auto_cast = 0 & $info_text = $sententia_help[1] & gt $curloc\"><img src=\"content/pic/ui/buttons/legacy/sel_button.png\"></a></div><div id=\"chekbox_203\"><a href = \"EXEC: silent_auto_cast = 0 & gt $curloc\"><img src=\"content/pic/ui/butt